aragraph\" >Deflection isn't the answer to everything\u2014special attacks require special responses. Hook attacks, projectiles, leaping attacks, and many others will require a specific response, whether it's holding down your guard or catching an incoming swing with your bare hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d0ff6477893e23f3792c769126cc5487.poster.avif?t=1747224911\" width=640 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d0ff6477893e23f3792c769126cc5487.webm?t=1747224911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/d0ff6477893e23f3792c769126cc5487.mp4?t=1747224911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A personal tale of self-worth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Iruruu\u2014a girl from a remote tribe in the Western steppes of imperial China. She's suddenly called upon by the Celestial Court to become a royal consort in the rear palace. Although reluctant to leave behind her quiet and peaceful life in the steppes, she embarks on this mission knowing it will bring great political influence to her tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Iruruu quickly learns of the danger of her desirable position, and she's forced to take up arms and defend herself from competing factions seeking to kill and replace her. In this unfamiliar land, she'll question whether she's truly fit to become 'princess' in the court that resides over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.poster.avif?t=1747224911\" width=640 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.webm?t=1747224911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704290/extras/36df033a13166f021fb9f22dd536dd67.mp4?t=1747224911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "False Princess Iruruu is an action-packed, story-rich adventure game with a rhythmic, Sekiro-like combat system. Follow Iruruu, a girl from the western steppes of China, as she embarks on a dangerous journey to fulfill a summons from the royal Qing court.",
